          "text": "Il est sain et sauf.",
          "translation": "Он цел и невредим.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10467666 @Julien_PDC / #10742506 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10467666",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
