          "id": "7047006",
          "text": "Retournons au début.",
          "translation": "Вернёмся к началу.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #7047006 @Aiji / #7094772 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/7047006",
