          "text": "Elles seront prêtes.",
          "translation": "Они будут готовы.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #2076925 @Amastan / #10836264 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/2076925",
