          "text": "Tu es un gamin.",
          "translation": "Ты мальчишка.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13939805 @madjidoumnia / #14000673 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13939805",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "gamin-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "9598565",
          "text": "Il est encore gamin.",
          "translation": "Он ещё мальчишка.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #9598565 @Rafik / #10001299 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/9598565",
