          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "aille-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3218969",
          "text": "Qu'elle aille au Diable !",
          "translation": "Пусть идёт к чёрту!",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3218969 @sacredceltic / #3813192 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3218969",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "aille-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1811141",
          "text": "Allez, que ça aille bien !",
          "translation": "Давай, пусть всё пройдёт хорошо!",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1811141 @sacredceltic / #11127509 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1811141",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
